# Repository-root allowlist. Vercel applies this file to the whole Git tree
# before Root Directory becomes the publish root. Keep both public project
# roots, and nothing else, so a Famous root and a preview root can each deploy.
# Private PHP, SQL, historical pages, provenance, and tests stay ignored.
/*
!/preview/
!/preview/**
!/famous-demo/
!/famous-demo/**
/famous-demo/test_demo.mjs
/famous-demo/README.md
